          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rare disease that can also be functional but should be considered on the differential of any adrenal mass, esp. tumors >4cm "
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
